<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102589" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦρος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bull</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.481
			</span></i>, etc.; as a sacrifice to Poseidon, <i><span class="en">
				11.728
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.181
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦρος βοῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.389
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπεχε τῆς βοὸς τὸν τ</span>.,
			oracularly of Agamemnon and his wife, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1126
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>priest of Poseidon Taureios</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				10.425c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> a kind of
			Lycian boat with bull as figurehead, postulated to explain Europa's
			bull, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.83
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>the bull as a sign of the Zodiac</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eudox.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Hipparch.
				1.2.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				167
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.1307
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				7.363.8
			</span></i> (Dura-Europus, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοχώνη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.173
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.706
			</span></i>: also <i>the pudenda muliebria</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>: <i>the male</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰδοῖον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i> (Cf. Lat. <i>taurus</i>, Lith. <i>tauras</i>, Slav.
				<i>tur[ucaron]</i>, etc.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
